`X25519MLKEM768` and the other ML-KEM groups require OpenSSL 3.5 or later. Earlier versions, including OpenSSL 3.0, do not recognize the name. If it appears in the NGINX or Apache configurations below, the server refuses to start; an `openssl.cnf` `Groups` line is instead ignored without an error, so none of the groups it lists are applied. Check which OpenSSL version the server uses first (for example with `openssl version` or `nginx -V`), and omit `X25519MLKEM768` from the list on older versions.
